WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.812 --> 00:00:04.145
(energetic tonal music)

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:08.880
- I'm at the Nangang Exhibition
center in Taipei City

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.730
where FOXCONN is having it's

00:00:10.730 --> 00:00:12.510
2021 tech day.

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:15.630
FOXCONN is best known for
assembling iPhones for Apple,

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.690
and it announced three
of it's own EV models.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:21.713
Including a SUV, a sedan,
and an electric bus.

00:00:23.443 --> 00:00:26.892
- (speaks in foreign language)

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:30.225
(energetic tonal music)

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:41.316
- (speaks in foreign language)

00:00:50.723 --> 00:00:53.900
(crowd applauds)

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:57.317
(classical string music)

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:05.180
- FOXCONN is the world's largest

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.060
contract electronics manufacturer,

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:08.880
and has been moving
further and further into

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:10.840
the automotive industry in an attempt

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.410
to diversify it's business.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:15.100
Over the past year, it
has announced a series of

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.820
deals and partnerships.

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.360
Most recently, it has
said that it will buy

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:22.840
an Ohio factory from electric truck maker

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:23.880
LORDSTOWN Motors.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:26.330
As a part of that, LORDSTOWN
said that it would also use

00:01:26.330 --> 00:01:27.980
FOXCONN to manufacture it's vehicles,

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:30.853
including it's debut
electric pick-up truck.

00:01:30.853 --> 00:01:34.186
(energetic tonal music)

00:01:37.660 --> 00:01:39.380
Given FOXCONN's supply chain experience

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.670
and existing relationship with Apple,

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:43.107
that could put it in a
particularly good position

00:01:43.107 --> 00:01:46.890
for manufacturing any
potential future Apple cars.

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:49.870
As far as Apple car comments or news goes,

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:52.893
the company has not said
anything on that front.

00:01:54.033 --> 00:01:57.366
(energetic tonal music)

